Provides: qemu-system-x86
Conflicts: qemu-system-x86
Replaces: qemu-system-x86
Description: QEMU x86 system emulator with QMX configuration support
 QEMU-QMX provides the standard qemu-system-i386 and
 qemu-system-x86_64 executables with QMX machine configuration support.
 .
 This package intentionally replaces the distribution qemu-system-x86
 package rather than installing a side-by-side emulator binary.
